window.MC_CONTENT_EXTRA.push({"a":"urgot","b":"locke","win":["Urgot","Urgot","Urgot","Urgot","Urgot","Urgot","Urgot"],"spikes":[{"when":"Lvl 1-3","text":"Corrosive Charge slow into W Purge with shotgun legs shreds him inside your range; his Q Ritual Nails poke cannot compete with your sustained DPS, so zone him hard off the wave."},{"when":"Lvl 6","text":"Fear Beyond Death ends the execute race before it starts - his W self-damage drops him toward 25 percent for you, and one landed R chain is a guaranteed kill his E reset cannot escape."},{"when":"1st item","text":"Your bruiser item makes you unburstable for his single W Soul Ignition window; keep walking him down, because he has no second plan once the burst fails."},{"when":"Late","text":"In sidelanes and fights your suppress-execute deletes him on sight - flip him with E Disdain when he dashes, then R the moment your shred puts him low."}],"wants":{"you":["Trades locked inside your Purge and leg range","E Disdain saved to flip his E Ashen Pursuit","R Fear Beyond Death the second he dips low"],"foe":["Chip from beyond your shotgun-leg range","A clean W burst window while your shield is down","R Purgatory placed where your R cannot answer"]},"early":"Levels 1-3 you simply out-stat him: Corrosive Charge slows him into W Purge, every leg blast of Echoing Flames chunks his squishy frame, and his own W Soul Ignition burns his health to fight back - park the wave near your side and punish each walk-up until he is too low to contest CS.","mid":"Through 4-6 you stay ahead on tankiness and sustained DPS, then level 6 hands you the trump card: his kit wants a burst-execute race and Fear Beyond Death wins that race every time, because his self-damage does half your setup for you. Threaten R constantly - he has to play a screen away from you.","late":"Post-item nothing rescues him - your shred and durability outstat his one burst window, E Disdain flips his E Ashen Pursuit reset mid-dash, and any fight where he dips below the threshold ends with your chains dragging him under. His Purgatory totem cannot save a champion who is already being suppressed.","whys":["Corrosive Charge plus Echoing Flames leg shred out-trades his level-1 poke.","Your W Purge shred and zone control own level 2 inside your range.","Purge plus the Q slow dominates the level-3 all-in.","Your tankiness and sustained damage keep you ahead through 4-5.","Fear Beyond Death hard-counters his execute race at 6 - yours lands first.","Post-item your shred and durability outstat his single burst window.","Late, your suppress-execute beats both his Purgatory and his E escape."]});
