window.MC_CONTENT_EXTRA.push({"a":"urgot","b":"masteryi","win":["Urgot","Urgot","Urgot","Urgot","Skill","Urgot","Urgot"],"spikes":[{"when":"Lvl 1-3","text":"You out-range his entire kit: Q slow into Purge legs pokes him off the wave. Alpha Strike is untargetable, so hold Disdain for his landing, not for the dash."},{"when":"Lvl 6","text":"Fear Beyond Death makes every all-in he takes a coin he loses - once your shred puts him under the threshold, the chains land, and its lockdown cancels a Meditate channel."},{"when":"1st item","text":"Your item spike outpaces his - he needs several completed items while your W DPS is already lethal. Buy Grievous Wounds early; Meditate is a 10s heal that refills him."},{"when":"Late","text":"Even scaled, a caught Yi is a dead Yi: flip his dash with E, chunk with legs and Purge, and R him at the threshold before Highlander lets him kite away."}],"wants":{"you":["The wave pinned near your tower with W control","E Disdain held to cancel his Alpha Strike engage","R chains at threshold before he can Meditate"],"foe":["Untouched farming into his item spikes","Alpha Strike timings that dodge your Q and R","Late fights where Highlander outruns your legs"]},"early":"From level 1 you out-range his Q dash and poke him off the wave, and it only gets uglier for him: at 2 your W shred plus wave control pins him away from CS, and at 3 Disdain punishes the Alpha Strike landing, since he is untargetable in flight - a melee champion with no items into a shotgun battery.","mid":"Through 4-5 you out-DPS and out-range him at every step, and there is only a brief breath before your ultimate arrives. Once Fear Beyond Death is up, any all-in he takes is a free kill - your shred drops him under the threshold, and Meditate is a channel your R's lockdown cancels outright.","late":"Late game the duel stays yours: Echoing Flames legs and Purge shred melt him faster than Wuju Style's true damage melts you, and R executes him the moment he dips. Highlander makes him immune to slows, so your Q and Purge slows do nothing while it is up - fight through it or wait the 85s.","whys":["You out-range his Q dash and poke him off the wave from level 1.","At 2 your W shred plus wave control keep him pinned and bleeding CS.","Level 3 your E Disdain flip cancels his dash and denies any trade he starts.","Through 4-5 you out-DPS and out-range him at every step.","Right at level 5 it reads even for a moment - a brief skill window before your ultimate arrives.","At 6 your R execute makes any all-in he takes a free kill for you.","Late, Echoing Flames legs, Purge shred and the R threshold keep it yours."]});
